#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `NoiseLearner` `run()` method takes a list of circuits or PUBs, whereas the `NoiseLearnerV3` `run()` method takes a list of instructions, each of which must be a twirling-annotated [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) containing ISA operations.\n"
"Convenience methods are available for generating the annotated boxes, depending on which\n"
"primitive you plan to use.\n"
msgstr ""

